// PSEXEC Remote Execution File Artefact | T1136.002, T1543.003, T1570 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/file/file_event/file_event_win_sysinternals_psexec_service_key.yml
DeviceFileEvents
| where FolderPath startswith "C:\\Windows\\PSEXEC-" and FolderPath endswith ".key"
